---
import { BRAND_NAME } from "@/config/brand";
import { RISK_PATH, TERMS_RESTRICTED_PATH } from "@/config/copy";

const linkClass = "text-fg underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-fg-muted";
---

<section aria-labelledby="facts-title" class="band">
	<div class="mx-auto grid w-full max-w-site grid-cols-1 gap-4 px-5 py-14 sm:px-8 md:py-20 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-8">
		<h2 id="facts-title" class="label lg:col-span-3 lg:pt-1">Before you trade</h2>
		<p class="max-w-3xl text-base text-fg-muted lg:col-span-9">
			Perpetual futures use leverage and can be liquidated; you can lose all of your margin. HIP-3 markets are deployed
			by independent third parties and can be halted, settled or delisted, and their liquidity can be thin. Contracts
			that reference companies give you no ownership in them, and {BRAND_NAME} is not affiliated with or endorsed by
			those companies. {BRAND_NAME} is an independent interface, not Hyperliquid Corp. or the Hyper Foundation. It is not
			intended for, and may not be used by, persons who reside in, are located in or are incorporated in the United
			States or other restricted locations listed in the <a href={TERMS_RESTRICTED_PATH} class={linkClass}>Terms of Use</a>;
			deployers may apply their own restrictions. Not financial advice.
			<a href={RISK_PATH} class={linkClass}>Risk disclosure →</a>
		</p>
	</div>
</section>
